{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) x<sup>2</sup> - 3x + 1 = 0 হলে, x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 9", "option2": "খ) 18", "option3": "গ) 27", "option4": "ঘ) 36", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - 3x + 1 = 0 <br />বা, x - 3 + 1/x = 0<br />বা, x + 1/x = 3<br />বা, (x + 1/x)<sup>3</sup> = 3<sup>3</sup><br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> + 3.x.1/x(x + 1/x) = 27<br />বা, x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> = 27 - 3.3 = 18</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x = 2 + &radic;3 হলে, x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 7", "option2": "খ) 6", "option3": "গ) 12", "option4": "ঘ) 14", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x = 2 + &radic;3<br />&there4; 1/x = 2 - &radic;3<br />&there4; x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> <br />= (2 + &radic;3)<sup>2</sup> + (2 - &radic;3)<sup>2</sup> <br />= 2{2<sup>2</sup> + (&radic;3)<sup>2</sup>} <br />= 2(4 + 3) <br />= 14</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> = 0 হলে, x<sup>4</sup> + 1 = ?", "option1": "ক) x", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "গ) x<sup>3</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>4</sup>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>3</sup> + 1/x<sup>3</sup> = 0<br />বা, (x + 1/x)<sup>3</sup> - 3.x.1/x(x + 1/x) = 0<br /> বা, (x + 1/x)<sup>3</sup> - 3(x + 1/x) = 0<br />বা,&nbsp;(x + 1/x) {(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> - 3} = 0<br />বা, (x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> - 3 = 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> + 2.x.1/x - 3 = 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> + 2 - 3 = 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> = 1<br />&there4; x<sup>4</sup> + 1 = x<sup>2</sup></p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) x - 1/x = 1 হলে, x<sup>2</sup> - 1/x<sup>2</sup> = ?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) &radic;5", "option3": "গ) &radic;3", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> <br />= (x - 1/x)<sup>2</sup> + 4.x.1/x <br />= 1<sup>2</sup> + 4 = 5<br />x + 1/x =&nbsp;&radic;5&nbsp;<br />&there4; x<sup>2</sup> - 1/x<sup>2</sup> <br />= (x + 1/x)(x - 1/x) <br />=&nbsp;&radic;5.1 <br />=&nbsp;&radic;5</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x + y = 10 এবং xy = 24 হলে, x = ? [x &gt; y]", "option1": "ক) 4", "option2": "খ) 6", "option3": "গ) 8", "option4": "ঘ) 10", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>(x - y)<sup>2</sup> <br />= (x + y)<sup>2</sup> - 4xy <br />= 10<sup>2</sup> - 4.24 <br />= 4&nbsp;<br />&there4; x - y = 2<br /><br />&there4; (x + y) + (x - y) = 10 + 2 <br />বা, 2x = 12&nbsp;<br />&there4; x = 6</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) x<sup>2</sup> - 8x - 8y + 16 + y<sup>2</sup> এর সংগে কত বিয়োগ করলে বিয়োগফল একটি পূর্ণবর্গ হবে?", "option1": "ক) -2xy", "option2": "খ) 2xy", "option3": "গ) -4xy", "option4": "ঘ) 4xy", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - 8x - 8y + 16 + y<sup>2 </sup><br />= (x + y - 4)<sup>2</sup> - 2xy<br /><br />&there4; প্রদত্ত রাশি থেকে -2xy বিয়োগ করলে বিয়োগফল পূর্ণ বর্গ হবে।</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) a + b = -c হলে, a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) abc", "option2": "খ) 3abc", "option3": "গ) 6abc", "option4": "ঘ) 9abc", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>a + b = -c<br />&there4; a + b + c = 0<br />এখন,<br />a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> <br />= a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> - 3abc + 3abc<br /> = (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> - ab - bc - ca) + 3abc<br /> = 0 + 3abc <br />= 3abc</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> - 1 = 0 হলে, x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> =কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) &radic;5", "option4": "ঘ) &radic;3", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>দেওয়া আছে, x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;- x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 1 = 0 <br />বা, x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 1 - 1/x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 0&nbsp;<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 1/x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 1&nbsp;<br />বা, (x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 1/x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 1<br />বা, (x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 1/x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 4.x<sup>2</sup>.1/x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 1&nbsp;<br />বা, (x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 1/x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- 4 = 1&nbsp;<br />বা, (x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 1/x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 5&nbsp;<br />&there4; x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 1/x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;=&nbsp;&radic;5</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) x + 1/x = 2 হলে, (x-1)/(x<sup>3</sup>-1) = ?", "option1": "ক) 1/3", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) অসংজ্ঞায়িত", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x + 1/x = 2<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 1 = 2x<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 1 = 0<br />বা, (x - 1)<sup>2</sup> = 0<br />&there4; x = 1<br /><br />এখন, x - 1/x<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>- 1 <br />= (1-1)/(1-1)<br />= 0/0<br />= অসংজ্ঞায়িত</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) 1/(2-x) এর সাথে কত যোগ করলে যোগফল (x-3)/(x-2) হবে?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) x", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>(x-3)/(x-2) - 1/(2-x)<br />= (x-3)/(x-2) + 1/(x-2)<br />= x - 3 + 1/(x-2) <br />= (x-2)/(x-2)<br />= 1<br /><br />&there4; (x-3)/(x-2) = 1 + 1/(2-x)<br />অর্থ্যাৎ, প্রদত্ত রাশিটির সাথে 1 যোগ করতে হবে।</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) -{(-x) - (-y)} এর সাথে -(z - y) এর যোগফল = ?", "option1": "ক) x + 2y + z", "option2": "খ) x - z", "option3": "গ) z - x", "option4": "ঘ) x - y", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>-{(-x) - (-y)}<br />= -(-x + y) <br />= x - y <br /><br />এবং -(z - y) <br />= y - z<br /><br />&there4; যোগফল = x - y + y - z <br />= x - z</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) (x-1)(x<sup>2</sup>+x+1) থেকে x<sup>3</sup> বিয়োগ করলে বিয়োগফল = ?", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>(x - 1)(x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1) = x<sup>3</sup> - 1&nbsp;<br />&there4; বিয়োগফল = x<sup>3</sup> - 1 - x<sup>3</sup> <br />= -1</p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) a - b, a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup> এবং a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup> এর গ.সা.গু. কত?", "option1": "ক) a+b", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) a-b", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>2</sup>-b<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>১ম রাশি = a - b, <br />২য় রাশি = a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup> = (a + b)(a - b)<br />৩য় রাশি = a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup> = (a - b)(a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)&nbsp;<br />&there4;&nbsp;গ.সা.গু. =&nbsp;a - b</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 এবং x<sup>2</sup> + 5x + 6 এর ল. সা.গু. = ?", "option1": "ক) (x+1)(x+3)", "option2": "খ) (x+2)(x+3)", "option3": "গ) (x+1)(x+2)", "option4": "ঘ) (x+1)(x+2)(x+3)", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> + 3x + 2 = (x + 1)(x + 2)<br />এবং x<sup>2</sup> + 5x + 6 = (x + 3)(x + 2)<br />&there4; ল. সা.গু. = (x + 1)(x + 2)(x + 3)</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) নিচের কোন সংখ্যাটি 1/(x - 1) এর মান হতে পারে না?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) -1", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 1/2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>1/(x - 1) = 0 হলে, 1 = 0 হয় যা অসম্ভব।</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) কোন সংখ্যার 1/2 অংশের সাথে 6 যোগ করলে যোগফল সংখ্যাটির 3/2 অংশ হবে?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) 6", "option3": "গ) 9", "option4": "ঘ) 12", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>ধরি, সংখ্যাটি x<br />&there4; x/2 + 6 = 3x/2<br />বা, 6 = 3x/2 - x/2 = 3x-x/2<br />বা, 6 = 2x/2<br />&there4; x = 6</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) দু'টি সংখ্যার বর্গের সমষ্টি এবং অন্তরফল যথাক্রমে 5 এবং 3 হলে সংখ্যা দু'টির গুণফল = ?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>সংখ্যা দু'টি = x,y<br />&there4; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 5 এবং x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> = 3<br />&there4; 4x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup> = (x<sup>2</sup>+y<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> - (x<sup>2</sup>-y<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = 5<sup>2</sup> - 3<sup>2</sup> = 16<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup> = 4<br />&there4; xy = 2</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) a<sup>2</sup>bc, ab<sup>2</sup>c, abc<sup>2</sup> এর গ. সা.গু. = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) abc", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup>c<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "3", "exp": " a<sup>2</sup>bc, ab<sup>2</sup>c, abc<sup>2</sup> এর গ. সা.গু. = abc."}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) দু'টি সংখ্যার অনুপাত 3:4 এবং তাদের ল.সা.গু. = 180 হলে গ.সা.গু = ?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 12", "option3": "গ) 45", "option4": "ঘ) 15", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>সংখ্যা দু'টি 3x, 4x<br />&there4; ল.সা.গু. = 180, গ.সা.গু = x<br />&there4; 3x &times; 4x = 180 &times; x<br />বা, 12x = 180<br />&there4; x = 15</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) 3/x = 1 এবং y/4 = 3 হলে (3+y)/(x+2) = ?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 3", "option3": "গ) 4", "option4": "ঘ) 5", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>3/x = 1 এবং y/4 = 3<br />&there4; x = 3 এবং y = 12<br />&there4; (3+y)/(x+2) = (3+12)/(3+2)<br />= 15/5<br />= 3</p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1200000, "pk": 2491, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 2491}